        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "To facilitate the test for vertical alignment it is necessary to adjust, as closely as possible, the axis of the tail-stock spindle in-line with the axis of the headstock spindle in the horizontal plane. The preliminary adjustment is accomplished by the following set up:",
